register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 10mL @ 25C
add v2 water 10mL @ 25C
add v1 NaCl 0.00001mol
add v2 NaCl 0.00001mol
inspect
dilute v1 100mL
dilute v2 20mL
dilute v2 100mL
measure v1 volume
measure v2 volume
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
measure v1 balance
measure v2 balance
inspect
